			title: "Creeper and Blaze Models"
			x: 14.0d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5795EAFBAB034E45"]
			description: [
				"Breathes in air for the centrifuge to split into nitrogen and oxygen. It works in the Void and the Flatlands as well as the Overworld, which stock GregTech doesn't allow."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:lv_gas_collector"
			id: "09FAB2A84C90B5D6"
			rewards: [{ id: "4C62188771A6494D", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "237690F5149BA95F", item: "gtceu:lv_gas_collector", type: "item" }]
			title: "Gas Collector"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["09FAB2A84C90B5D6"]
			description: [
				"Pulls compounds apart with electricity and nothing else. Its big job right now is sapphire, which splits into aluminium and oxygen, and aluminium is your way into MV."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:lv_electrolyzer"
			id: "50622961B58725B8"
			rewards: [{ id: "1737F89DF7F3A701", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "18B27DABA1F1A8A8", item: "gtceu:lv_electrolyzer", type: "item" }]
			title: "Electrolyzer"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["50622961B58725B8"]
			description: [
				"LV's small chemistry happens here: sulfuric acid, iron chloride, and the sodium bisulfate that the electrolyzer turns into persulfate. Both of those etch circuit boards."
				"The hydrogen they give off goes in a tank, not the sky. MV turns it into methanol."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:lv_chemical_reactor"
			id: "09155B5B0F1BE994"
			rewards: [{ id: "73880280BC223A89", type: "xp", xp: 35 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "5B7E3A5E7F5D45F7", item: "gtceu:lv_chemical_reactor", type: "item" }]
			title: "Chemical Reactor"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["09155B5B0F1BE994"]
			description: [
				"It mixes things, as advertised. Here that means drilling fluid, gallium arsenide, the roaster's contact mass and even AE2's fluix crystal."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:lv_mixer"
			id: "3C89167418EA462B"
			rewards: [{ id: "3FE8B3BDBC000C5D", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "4BE599CF418E61FB", item: "gtceu:lv_mixer", type: "item" }]
			title: "Mixer"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3879D8323DF4F8BB"]
			description: [
				"Makes circuits in batches, so your hands can retire from soldering. It needs MV circuits in its own recipe, which is why it waits until now."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:lv_circuit_assembler"
			id: "220C6C2F1D568194"
			rewards: [{ id: "32A9BD5A41455BB9", type: "xp", xp: 35 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "5899D39CB5599808", item: "gtceu:lv_circuit_assembler", type: "item" }]
			title: "Circuit Assembler"
			x: 16.0d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["09155B5B0F1BE994"]
			description: [
				"A better board than the resin one: a phenolic board, etched with silver foil in sodium persulfate or iron chloride, whichever you have more of. That is what all the chemistry was for."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:phenolic_printed_circuit_board"
			id: "5F2D3E9A2F35D8E0"
			rewards: [{ id: "3CCE26DF092C48D3", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ count: 4L, id: "45C73EBE75172899", item: "gtceu:phenolic_printed_circuit_board", type: "item" }]
			title: "Good Circuit Board"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5F2D3E9A2F35D8E0"]
			description: [
				"Gallium and arsenic go into the mixer as gallium arsenide, and the assembler turns that into diodes. Arsenic comes out of realgar in the centrifuge, gallium out of bauxite."
				"Diodes are the last piece the MV circuit is waiting on."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:diode"
			id: "0785A341666D046E"
			rewards: [{ id: "47C80CB0BB026BC9", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ count: 4L, id: "10F2763E413CF2FB", item: "gtceu:diode", type: "item" }]
			title: "Diodes"
			x: 12.0d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0785A341666D046E"]
			description: [
				"You can make the &6Good Electronic Circuit&r by hand, no MV power needed. That's lucky, because the circuit assembler won't build without it, so make a few."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:good_electronic_circuit"
			id: "3879D8323DF4F8BB"
			rewards: [{ id: "7A7D7E619B5877B2", type: "xp", xp: 45 }]
			tasks: [{ count: 4L, id: "01134F436F85414C", item: "gtceu:good_electronic_circuit", type: "item" }]
			title: "MV Circuit"
			x: 14.0d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["220C6C2F1D568194"]
			description: [
				"Stamps shaped parts out of plates. In this pack it also stamps AE2's processor presses out of steel plate, so you can skip the meteorite hunting."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:lv_forming_press"
			id: "2C50918B882FA400"
			rewards: [{ id: "04A087AC4B66AAE9", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
